                        "code": "// Mesh-Warp: vec2 warp(vec2 uv) liefert die QUELL-UV je Gitterpunkt.\n// Uniforms: uTime, uDelta, uFrame, uResolution, bass, mid, treb, vol, beat\nvec2 warp(vec2 uv)\n{\n    vec2 d = uv - 0.5;\n    float winkel = 0.30 * sin(uTime * 0.3) + 1.2 * bass * exp(-6.0 * dot(d, d));\n    float s = sin(winkel);\n    float c = cos(winkel);\n    float zoom = 1.0 + 0.03 * sin(uTime * 0.9) + 0.05 * treb;\n    return 0.5 + mat2(c, -s, s, c) * d / zoom;\n}\n",
